    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present a unique opportunity to acquire this glorious 4 bed, 2.5 bath detached family home originally built c.1937, that has been extended. Set on a large approx. 0.4acre plot with stunning landscaped gardens. South facing to the rear overlooking Deerpark golf course. The current owners have really looked after this fine home and gardens. Great location close to Howth Village, Burrow Beach and Sutton Cross.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises; entrance hall, guest wc, livingroom, diningroom, kitchen / breakfast room, tv room, conservatory, home office / study, and utility room. Upstairs are 4 double bedrooms, main bedroom has ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, and there is a family bathroom.\n\nLocation is excellent, minutes from Howth Village and Burrow Beach. With a great combination of natural beauty and great amenities on your doorstep including; beaches, Howth village with its quaint shops, gastro-bars and fine restaurants along with great transport links including bus & DART train to&from Dublin City Centre. Dublin Airport is close by too. There is a great selection of excellent public and private schools. Sports & leisure facilities are well catered for too with world class yacht club, golf clubs and rugby club amongst others. The close-by Marine Hotel has a leisure centre and swimmingpool."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 2.9m x 5.9m\nAlarm Control Panel, Period Front Door, Oval Lead Glass Window.\n\nGuest WC - 1.9m x 1.9m\nWHB, WC, Tiled Floor.\n\nLiving Room - 3.6m x 5.3m\nOpen Fire With Cast Iron Grate, Slate Inset & Hearth, Period Wooden Mantlepiece, Coving, TV Point, Carpet, Oval Lead Glass Window To Front, French Doors Out To Conservatory.\n\nDining Room - 3.6m x 4.1m\nCoving, Carpet, Wall Lights, Glass Door Out To Patio and Rear Garden.\n\nKitchen/Breakfast Room - 3.3m x 6.8m\nNewly Fitted Hand-painted Kitchen designed and installed By 'Mooneys', Double Oven, Hob, Extractor Fan, Integrated Dishwasher, oil-fired AGA, Tiled Floor, Recess Lights.\n\nTV Room - 2.6m x 4.0m\nWide-plank engineered Oak Timber Floor, Open Fire With Cast Iron Inset, Stone Hearth, Cherrywood Mantlepiece, TV Point.\n\nRear Hall - 4.0m x 1.2m\nTiled Floor, Glass Door To Rear Garden, Wall cabinets.\n\nUtility Room - 1.6m x 2.1m\nPlumbed For Washing Machine & Tumble Dryer, Tiled Floor, Cabinets.\n\nConservatory - 6.7m x 3.5m\nA Norman Pratt Conservatory, Cedarwood Timber Framed, Double Glazed Windows All Round, Tiled Floor, Fan Light, French Doors Out To Patio and Rear Garden.\n\nStudy - 3.6m x 5.2m\nHome Office/Study/Den/Playroom.Carpet, Velux, Recess Lights, Fitted Cabinets & Desk, Future Proofed Construction To Take A First Floor Extension, (Subject To P.P)\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 1.9m x 7.15m\nHot Press, Pull down ladder to attic with part flooring and light.\n\nBedroom 1 (Rear) - 3.7m x 3.5m\nCarpet, Wall Lights.\n\nWalk In Wardrobe - 1.3m x 1.6m\nFitted Rails & Shelving.\n\nEnsuite - 1.8m x 1.6m\nWHB, WC, Corner Shower, Fully Tiled, Extractor Fan.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.6m x 5.3m\nDual Aspect, Carpet.\n\nBedroom 3 (Rear) - 2.7m x 4.2m\nBuilt-In Wardrobes, Carpet, WHB, Glass Door Out To Balcony, Overlooking Rear Garden.\n\nBedroom 4 (Rear) - 3.6m x 3.6m\nBuilt-In Wardrobes, carpet.\n\nBathroom - 2.2m x 1.6m\nWhb, wc, bath, fully tiled.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront Garden - \nStone Wall, Gated Pillars, Sweeping Pebble Driveway, Manicured Lawn, Box hedging And Flower Beds, Gated Side Entrance.\n\nRear Garden - \nSouth Facing, Overlooking Deerpark Golf Course, Walled, Manicured Lawn, Ornate Box Hedging, Landscaped Flowerbeds, 2 x Block Built Sheds.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Detached 4 Bedroom, 2.5 Bathrooms. built c.1937.</li><li>Extended.</li><li>Conservatory.</li><li>Landscaped gardens.</li><li>South facing to rear.</li><li>Oil Fired Central Heating.</li><li>Double Glazed Windows.</li><li>Alarm.</li><li>Gated Off Street Parking.</li><li>Approx. 222sqm / 2,390sqft.</li><li>Approx. 0.4acre plot.</ul>"
